{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "streaming/an-answer-scope-streams-only-to-a-target-it-names",
  "title": "An answer scope naming streaming transports streams to the first it names, delivers the answer whole to the others it names, and nothing to the rest",
  "rules": [
    "§12.2 step 11s",
    "§5.12",
    "§7.3 An event's visibility"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_response_visibility.py::TestResponseVisibilitySingleChannel::test_streaming_only_to_targeted_channel (room-1), TestResponseVisibilityCommaSeparated::test_comma_separated_streaming_targets (room-2), TestResponseVisibilityStoredEvent::test_stored_event_has_visibility (the stored answer takes the scope).",
  "setup": {
